# Ral, Crackling Wit's emblem: "Instant and sorcery spells you cast have storm." A copy of a card that is cast (CR 707.12,
# 722.3c: a prepare spell's) is a spell its caster cast, so it has storm; a copy of a spell is not cast (CR 707.10) and has
# none. Ral reaches 10 loyalty as in its -10 scenario (4 on entering, +1 on turns 1, 3 and 5, then Mox Emerald, Mox Amber
# and Mox Ruby on turn 7) and gives Bot1 the emblem. Bot1 then casts Carnivorous Cultivator (Forest and Mox Ruby), which
# enters prepared, and casts its Enroot from exile with Mox Emerald: four spells were cast before it this turn, so storm
# makes four copies. The copies were not cast and storm no more: five searches in all, five Islands in the graveyard.

